  "description": "Carter Kennedy, an abandoned adoptee from the Kennedy family. After enduring endless scorn and neglect, he is sold as a servant to a mansion. But the man who bought him is none other than Colton, a fellow orphan from the same orphanage, the boy Carter thought he’d never see again after “that day.” Carter is terrified by Colton’s strange, obsessive attachment to him, a stark contrast to their past, and tries to escape from him...\n\n *“All I want is for you to be my family.”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
